{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07355","headline":"雨中登沛县楼赠表兄郭少府 · 刘长卿","name":"雨中登沛县楼赠表兄郭少府","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"楚泽秋更远，云雷有时作。\n晚陂带残雨，白水昏漠漠。\n伫立收烟氛，洗然静寥廓。\n卷帘高楼上，万里看日落。\n爲客频改弦，辞家尚如昨。\n故山今不见，此鸟那可托。\n小邑务常闲，吾兄宦何薄。\n高标青云器，独立沧江鹤。\n惠爱原上情，殷懃丘中诺。\n何当遂良愿，归卧青山郭。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘长卿","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_07355.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07355","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}